# Coverage tooling, kept in its own lock so it never enters the runtime image.
#
# Why a separate lock rather than adding these to the `dev` extra: regenerating
# `requirements.lock` with `uv --all-extras` also refreshes every other dependency,
# and that run moved sqlalchemy 2.0.52 -> 2.1.3, fastapi 0.141.1 -> 0.142.2 and
# starlette 1.6.0 -> 1.7.0 in `requirements-runtime.lock`. Shipping an unvalidated
# major-version change to the API image is a separate decision with its own review;
# it must not ride along with a measurement request.
#
# Versions are bounded to the same ranges the `dev` extra declares, so the resolved
# graph matches what the test environment already installs. pytest itself is a
# shared dependency: this file must not raise its floor above the `dev` extra's.
coverage>=7.0,<8.0
pytest-cov>=6.0,<8.0
